---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/writing-voice-typed-dictated-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/writing-voice-typed-dictated-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="The same person reads differently typed and spoken"
  caption="372 work chat messages I typed, May through August 2026, against 225 I dictated in September and October."
>
  Paired bars comparing work chat messages I typed with ones I dictated. Starts lowercase: 61 percent typed, 18 percent
  dictated. Ends on a period: 16 percent typed, 74 percent dictated. Has a double dash: 24 percent typed, 0 dictated.
  Has an emoji: 20 percent typed, 0 dictated. Says "I think", "I guess" or "I mean": 4 percent typed, 15 percent
  dictated.
</Chart>
